{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28034","headline":"镜湖西岛言事 · 朱庆余","name":"镜湖西岛言事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"慵拙幸便荒僻地，纵闻猨鸟亦何愁。\n偶因药酒欺梅雨，却着寒衣过麦秋。\n岁计有余添橡实，生涯一半在渔舟。\n世人若便无知己，应向此溪成白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}